# Every file on this branch is published verbatim and digested byte for byte.
#
# addons.xml is served to Kodi alongside addons.xml.sha256, and Kodi refuses the
# repository when the digest of what it downloaded disagrees with that file. Git's
# end-of-line conversion would rewrite the bytes on checkout, so a later checkout
# and re-commit on a machine configured differently from the one that generated
# the tree would silently invalidate every checksum here.
#
# -text disables that conversion for everything, which is correct on a branch that
# holds no source: the archives and images are binary already, and the two text
# files are content whose exact bytes are the contract.
* -text
